  "details": "[Stations used on Avatars section in VRC Station documentation][doc] refers \"The default `VRCChair` prefab included in the SDK\".\n\nHowever, the `VRCChair` prefab is not included in Avatars SDK so \"The default `VRCChair` prefab included in the SDK\" is missing.\n\n~~If we need to copy VRCChar from Worlds SDK, the document should say \"The default VRCChair prefab included in the Worlds SDK\" I think. ~~\n\nEDIT:  I found VRCChar3 from from Worlds SDK is only for worlds sdk, impossible to use with avatars SDK.\n\nHowever, I think it's better to include VRCChar prefab as a sample asset of Avatars SDK.\n\n[doc]: (https://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/components/vrc_station/#stations-used-on-avatars)",
